  "description": {
    "sub_id3": null,
    "sub_name": "設計方法",
    "sub_ename": "DESIGN METHODOLOGY",
    "describe_ch": "本課程旨在為學習者建立設計的基本認知，並藉由一系列導論與學習任務，帶領學生探討建築與室內設計的方法與程序間的關聯性，認識設計方法的基礎知識與相關理論，培養解析設計程序的思維技巧，藉此提升應用設計方法的能力。",
    "describe_eh": "This course aims to reconfirm the basic understanding of design and lead students to explore the design process and method in the field of architecture and interior design.Through a series of topic lectures and case studies, students will obtain the skills of applying analytical thinking and design methodology in the development of design creativity.",
